	"system": {
		"description": "<p>As a reaction to being targeted by a melee weapon attack, you fire at point blank range. When you do so, you do not have disadvantage on the attack roll due to being within the threatened area of another creature. You must declare that you’re using this reaction when you have been targeted but before your attacker rolls. If your attack reduces your target’s HP to 0, their attack does not occur.</p>",
